    ["<Assistant_Title1>【窥秘的角落】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>黑荆棘事件簿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Property1>19级</>后，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-黑荆棘事件簿-窥秘的角落</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与人数：</>5~6人组队，或选择人机模式前往。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>35装等金色装备、非凡物质等。每日1次奖励次数<Assistant_Red>（黑荆棘事件簿共享奖励次数）</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领攻略：</>{JumpToUI:[卡尔·埃德加]|1302139}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【A Corner of Mysteries】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Book</>\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </>After reaching <Assistant_Property1>Level 19</>, Beyonders can click <Assistant_System>Menu-World Adventure-Dungeon-Blackthorn Incident Book-A Corner of Mysteries</> to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2> Number of Participants: </>5~6 person team, or choose AI mode.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </>Level 35 Gold Equipment, Beyonder materials, etc. 1 reward count per day<Assistant_Red> (shared reward count for Blackthorn Incident Book)</>.\n<Assistant_Title2> Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[Karl Edgar]|1302139}",
