    ["一块精心切割的透明棱镜，能够折射光线，也能\"折射\"记忆的容量，让你的表演动作更加丰富多彩。"] = "A carefully cut transparent prism that can refract light and also \"refract\" the capacity of memory, making your performance movements more rich and colorful.",
    ["一年前的今天……我和我的孩子，被另一所济贫院分开安置……最终失散了。"] = "Today, one year ago... my child and I were separated by another poorhouse... and eventually lost each other.",
    ["不同的人脉之间也有着特殊的<Highlight>关系</>，集齐对应人脉即可解锁/提升相应的关系，精进自己对历史的研究。\n根据历史研究程度，可获得一定的属性加成。\n关系可分为<Highlight>协战关系</>和<Highlight>历史关系</>两类，两者都可以提升历史研究。\n对于协战关系，解锁后还能为部分人脉提供一定的能力增强，但是对于一个人脉只能生效一种协战关系的提升效果。\n\n在战略服中，当协战关系达到【本相】层次，能够连接命运支流的力量。使用<Highlight>支流结晶</>对其进行<Highlight>唤启</>，可以提升支流刻度，进而获取命运余响，提升余响音阶，以在战略服获得额外属性提升。（该属性仅在战略服生效）"] = "There are also special <Highlight>relationships</> between different contacts. Collecting corresponding contacts will unlock/upgrade the corresponding relationship, refining your research on history. \nDepending on the level of historical research, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships can be divided into two categories: <Highlight>Co-combat Relationship</> and <Highlight>Historical Relationship</>, both of which can improve historical research. \nFor Co-combat Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some contacts, but only one Co-combat Relationship enhancement effect can be active for a single contact. \n\nIn the Strategy Server, when a Co-combat Relationship reaches the [True Form] level, it can connect to the power of the tributary of fate. Use <Highlight>Tributary Crystals</> to <Highlight>Awaken</> it to increase the tributary scale, thereby obtaining Echoes of Fate and increasing the Echo Scale to gain additional attribute boosts in the Strategy Server. (This attribute only takes effect in the Strategy Server.)",
