    ["口感如气泡水般清甜爽口，药效期间可临时改变自身形象。该药发明人曾劝告，这是一场终将醒来的美梦，不要过分沉湎。"] = "The taste is as clear and refreshing as sparkling water, and the potion can temporarily change your appearance while in effect. The inventor of this potion once warned that this is a beautiful dream that will eventually end, so do not indulge in it too much.",
    ["只要在晚上虔诚地跪拜祂，就能得到生命的“祝福”，再也不会挨饿了。"] = "As long as you kneel and pray to Him devoutly at night, you can receive the 'blessing' of life and never go hungry again.",
    ["向混沌祈祷中"] = "Praying to Chaos...",
    ["吟游诗人携着鲁特琴，在广袤的大陆上收集故事，所有的故事终将伴着琴声，成为风格迥异的歌。\n据说，当吟游诗人的琴歌足够动人，能在一个地区的街巷与炉火间口耳相传，甚至点亮了听者的一丝明悟，那条旋律便会在琴弦的拨动中，汇集百感，凝结成音石。 \n佩戴音石时，故去的旋律将在耳边重新鸣响，故事中的情感也会充斥内心，层叠如潮涌。不同故事孕育的音石，其质感与情感也截然不同：\n当故事发生在辉煌的因蒂斯宫廷，凝结的音石往往光华流转，回荡着精致、浪漫而略带哀愁的贵族情思。当故事发生在信仰知识与智慧之神的地域，回响的情绪也更为平静、节制，仿佛一段被严密论证的哲思。\n吟游诗人乐于分享它们，就如乐于分享琴曲与歌声。"] = "Bards carry lutes, collecting stories across the vast continent. All stories will eventually accompany the sound of the strings, becoming songs of vastly different styles. \nIt is said that when a bard's lute song is moving enough to be passed down by word of mouth through the streets and hearths of a region, and even ignites a glimmer of enlightenment in the listener, that melody will gather a hundred feelings in the plucking of the strings, condensing into a Sound Stone. \nWhen wearing a Sound Stone, the melodies of the past will ring in your ears again, and the emotions within the stories will fill your heart, surging like a tide. Sound Stones born from different stories have vastly different textures and emotions: \nWhen a story takes place in the glorious Intis court, the condensed Sound Stone often shimmers with light, echoing with the exquisite, romantic, and slightly melancholic sentiments of the nobility. When a story takes place in a region that believes in the God of Knowledge and Wisdom, the echoing emotions are calmer and more restrained, as if they were a rigorously argued philosophical thought. \nBards are happy to share them, just as they are happy to share their lute music and songs.",
